   "note": "Data sheet, Dimensions and Weight: \"CM8148-10G, CM8132-10G, and CM8116-10G\" are 17.3 x 10.5 x 1.75 in, 440 x 265 x 44 mm, 1 RU. The data sheet does not name the -USB models in that row, so the width, depth and height of the base model are used here; the rear photograph is as wide as the front one (1961 and 1964 px), which supports the width and says nothing of the depth. No weight is stated for the -USB models and none is written. The rack kit 590037 ships in the box but no source dimensions it, so the body is drawn alone."
  },
  "front-layout": {
   "confidence": "estimated",
   "note": "Method: the CM8116-10G-USB front photograph (2560 x 1440, no scale marker, a slight downward view that shows a strip of the top) is measured against the data sheet envelope. The face is 1964 px wide for 440 mm, 4.46 px/mm across; it is 189 px high for 44 mm, 4.30 px/mm down, so the face is foreshortened about 4 percent in height and the positions down the face are the less sure. The positions across are good to about 1 mm and the ones down to about 1.5 mm. The serial pitch (14.3 mm, 64 px) is read on this face only."
  },
